#: ../../source/docs/trademark.rst:7
#: ac42a366e62e4029895e73e3857fdcd6
msgid "\"ArduPilot\" is a registered trademark in the United States."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/trademark.rst:9
#: 6e03039dc2ea4d2dab570e40b2aa112a
msgid "As mentioned on the `License page <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/license-gplv3.html>`__ we greatly appreciate those companies and individuals who have incorporated the ArduPilot software into their products for sale. A significant number have already done this and we expect many more to follow."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/trademark.rst:12
#: aec3e0da3501444db7e6d3f95b9a0d38
msgid "In general, the development team encourages the use of \"ArduPilot\" on products and services which incorporate the ArduPilot software but we request the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/trademark.rst:14
#: eceb7869bc08409ebd8f563d6e535e75
msgid "The company has thoroughly tested the product with ArduPilot and provides after sales support to the buyer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/trademark.rst:15
#: 4776c4a332f246dcb10598f3da4eb92f
msgid "An official stable release of ArduPilot is used or a release sanctioned by one of the members of the ArduPilot development team"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/trademark.rst:16
#: 3a5a6295fce844a4b3e74388a159abe2
msgid "The `ArduPilot license <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/license-gplv3.html>`__ is followed including allowing the owner of the product to upload custom or newer versions of ArduPilot to the flight controller (these custom versions do not actually need to work but it should be possible to upload them)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/trademark.rst:17
#: 7e1303dafb4842b690385740e42e3085
msgid "The product is not intended to cause harm to people or property"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/trademark.rst:18
#: 5156181be76d43f39fda54ca1f148de3
msgid "Please consider `becoming an ArduPilot partner <https://ardupilot.org/about/Partners>`__ to support the ongoing development and support of ArduPilot"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/trademark.rst:20
#: 3aab4edbf5474c12844fd892206b6371
msgid "If you have any further questions about using ArduPilot on your product, please get in touch with Andrew Tridgell or Randy Mackay through one of the methods listed on our `Contact Us page <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-contact-us.html>`__."
msgstr ""

